.vscode/

## Local operational output: database backups and migration-review / demo-reset logs.
## Backups and reset logs are written to %USERPROFILE%\SkyShiftBackups, outside the repo; these
## patterns are a second line of defence. Never commit them.
*.bak
_migration-review/*/
